5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Hello everyone. Since we have a shortage of bicycle spaces, we need a logical and fair way to allocate them. I believe we should start by examining the current situation and any past issues.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to see you all. I agree, Misaki. It would be wonderful if we could find a solution that keeps everyone happy and maintains the peace in our lovely building. I look forward to your ideas.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm looking forward to this! Let's make sure we don't just pick a plan that looks good on paper but is a total pain to actually do. I want to keep things lively and fair for everyone!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that we should be careful. A plan is only as good as its execution, and we must ensure it is sustainable for whoever manages it.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help out! I really want to make sure we're being fair to everyone, so let's figure out the best way to share the spaces! What should we check first?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will look into the ""Five years of association minutes"" and ""Last year's complaint log entries."" I want to understand the history of this issue and identify any recurring conflicts to avoid repeating past mistakes.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think it would be lovely to see the ""Morning departures watched from the entrance"" and ""Rain exposure along the parking rows."" I want to understand how our neighbors are faring in their daily routines.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll check the ""Building account's two-year ledger"" and the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections."" I'm curious about the money side of things—it's about time we actually looked at the costs!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"I will examine the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections"" and the ""Five years of association minutes."" I want to understand the actual administrative burden and how previous management attempts have fared over time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the ""Sticker register and the daily riders"" and ""Morning departures watched from the entrance""! I want to see who's actually using the bikes and if the spots match up with where they are!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@George, since we are both looking into the minutes, we can compare our findings later. I am particularly interested in whether previous allocation rules led to any long-term friction among the residents.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, it is so sweet of you to be so enthusiastic. Since we are both looking at the morning departures, perhaps we can share our observations and see if we noticed the same things.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@George, you're looking at the treasurer's files too! Let's see if we can finally uncover where the money is actually going. I have a feeling we'll find some surprises in those accounts!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,"@May, I am less interested in surprises and more concerned with the workload. I want to see if the collection process is a burden that will simply be abandoned again. Let us see what the records reveal.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, yes! Let's definitely compare notes! I'm super curious to see if the people who leave early are the ones getting the best spots. I hope we find some cool clues!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I believe we have a comprehensive plan for our research. By covering the financial, historical, and behavioral data, we can make an informed decision. I will begin my investigation now and see you all in the next round.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all take a moment to look into these things with a kind heart. I hope the information we find helps us create a peaceful arrangement for everyone. I shall see you all soon.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready to dive in! I'll be the one to uncover the financial secrets of this building. Let's see if the numbers are as boring as George thinks they are! See you all soon!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,I will proceed with my research. I intend to focus on the practicalities of the administration to ensure we do not create a system that is destined to fail. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm off to hunt for clues! I can't wait to see if the sticker register tells us the real story about who's parking where. See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
